  "prefLabel": "Hedc 212.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 212.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The commission shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #14403, eff 10-15-25\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nHedc 200 | RSA 541-A:16, I(b); RSA 541-A:30-a",
